.TH SYNORA-DESKTOP 1 "June 2026" "Synora Studio 1.0" "Synora Desktop Commands"
.SH NAME
synora-desktop \- Synora Studio Native Desktop Client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python desktop.py
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B synora-desktop
is the native PySide6 graphical user interface for Synora Studio. It connects to the local API Server to manage system prompts, chat history, and provide a seamless AI interaction experience without browser overhead.

.PP
\fBGRACEFUL DEGRADATION\fR
.br
If the graphical interface fails to initialize (e.g. executing on a remote server without \fBssh -X\fR X11 Forwarding enabled), the application will catch the fatal X11 error and gracefully route the user directly into the interactive Headless Engine mode, allowing the platform to still start in the background.
.SH OPTIONS
This application does not accept command-line arguments. All configuration is managed via the UI settings vault.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Launch the desktop client:
.B python desktop.py
.SH AUTHOR
Synora Studio Framework
